# The build context is src/. Only what docker/runner-ts/Dockerfile copies goes in: the fixture
# package without its local node_modules and its unit tests, the TypeScript entry, and the
# Python runner's page script. hoh.fidelity.stack.source_digest leaves out the same files.
*
!pwfix
!pwrun
!hoh_runner/quiet.js
pwfix/node_modules
pwfix/test
**/__pycache__
**/.*
